From 8a7f5c9047e905aff2c1260a0174d67581801576 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:46:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Base path and trusted proxy auth (railwatch-server prototype)

RAILWATCH_BASE_PATH serves every page under a prefix (/railwatch) while
/ingest and /up stay at the root; RAILWATCH_TRUSTED_PROXY_SECRET_FILE lets
a proxy in front name the signed-in user with an HMAC-signed, short-lived
X-Railwatch-Proxy-Auth header. Both off by default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
